{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12685","headline":"游石溪示学者 · 元结","name":"游石溪示学者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小溪在城下，形胜堪赏爱。\n尤宜春水满，水石更殊怪。\n长山势回合，井邑相萦带。\n石林绕舜祠，西南正相对。\n阶庭无争讼，郊境罢守卫。\n时时溪上来，劝引辞学辈。\n今谁不务武，儒雅道将废。\n岂忘二三子，旦夕相勉励。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}